# Hash-anchored files must round-trip byte-identically on every platform
# (gate-0002 review A4-C1): records quote SHA-256 of committed blob
# content, and CRLF checkouts (core.autocrlf=true on Windows hosts)
# made working-tree hashes unverifiable. Pin LF for the harness.
harness/** text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.md text
*.rs text
*.toml text
*.yml text
*.lock text
